00:35.220 --> 00:38.680
Paris. The end of the 19th century.
Beneath the glass ceiling of the Galerie du Roy,
one can see the thin silhouette of a Japanese girl named Yune.
For now, only a few Parisians know of her arrival...

00:35.220 --> 00:38.680
The crossing in a foreign maze

00:38.680 --> 00:44.060
As I open the gate and step out into the street

00:44.690 --> 00:48.730
asa no hikari ga mabushii

00:44.690 --> 00:48.730
朝の光が眩しい

00:44.690 --> 00:48.730
I can see the sun shining brightly

00:51.730 --> 00:56.740
doko kara ka nagareru hanauta ni

00:51.730 --> 00:56.740
どこからか流れる鼻歌に

00:51.730 --> 00:56.740
I can hear humming in the distance

00:57.910 --> 01:01.660
kokoro hazumi tokete yuku

00:57.910 --> 01:01.660
心弾み解けてゆく

00:57.910 --> 01:01.660
It moves me and melts my heart

01:04.870 --> 01:10.340
mabuta tojireba ukabu egao

01:04.870 --> 01:10.340
瞼閉じれば浮かぶ笑顔

01:04.870 --> 01:10.340
I can see that smile when I close my eyes

01:11.500 --> 01:16.930
omoidasu tabi ni namida hitotsu

01:11.500 --> 01:16.930
思い出す度に涙ひとつ

01:11.500 --> 01:16.930
It brings me to tears whenever I remember it

01:17.430 --> 01:20.550
te wo hiroge hashiridase

01:17.430 --> 01:20.550
手を広げ 走りだせ

01:17.430 --> 01:20.550
Spread your arms out and take off

01:20.550 --> 01:23.890
hi no ataru toori wo

01:20.550 --> 01:23.890
陽の当たる 通りを

01:20.550 --> 01:23.890
Down the streets where the lights shine

01:23.890 --> 01:30.440
michiyuku hito ni genki ni aisatsu

01:23.890 --> 01:30.440
道行く人に 元気に挨拶

01:23.890 --> 01:30.440
Cheerfully greet people walking down the city streets

01:30.440 --> 01:37.070
atarashii kimochi de shinkokyuu shitara

01:30.440 --> 01:37.070
新しい 気持ちで深呼吸したら

01:30.440 --> 01:37.070
Take a deep breath to refresh yourself

01:37.070 --> 01:45.580
kono sekai wa hora itsudemo kimi no mono

01:37.070 --> 01:45.580
この世界はほら いつでも 君のもの

01:37.070 --> 01:45.580
And this world will always be yours

01:51.000 --> 02:00.970
Episode 04 :

01:51.000 --> 02:00.970
"Light Reflecting off the Water"

02:21.280 --> 02:23.240
I'll be fine.

02:23.660 --> 02:24.080
Hey.

02:30.670 --> 02:33.500
Claude-sama, Oscar-sama...

02:34.500 --> 02:37.050
Why were you hiding from us?

02:37.050 --> 02:38.880
Um, I was eating cheese...

02:39.840 --> 02:42.140
What the- What did you put in it?!

02:42.140 --> 02:44.140
What's with this disgusting stuff?

02:44.140 --> 02:45.770
It isn't disgusting!

02:45.770 --> 02:47.140
It's soy sauce!

02:47.140 --> 02:48.810
It's a Japanese sauce!

02:48.810 --> 02:51.440
Japanese people actually use this stuff?

02:51.440 --> 02:53.020
Indeed.

02:53.020 --> 02:56.980
Japanese people put lots of soy sauce in their beef stew, too.

02:57.440 --> 02:58.690
Seriously?

02:58.690 --> 03:01.030
Are you talking about sukiyaki?

03:01.030 --> 03:02.530
Yes, that's it.

03:02.530 --> 03:04.780
It was very delicious.

03:04.780 --> 03:07.540
I'll prepare dinner tomorrow, then.

03:07.540 --> 03:08.410
What?

03:08.410 --> 03:10.040
You're going to make dinner?

03:10.040 --> 03:11.540
Are you sure?

03:11.540 --> 03:13.290
You're going to use this sauce, right?

03:13.290 --> 03:14.670
This is a good opportunity

03:14.670 --> 03:17.210
for you to try some Japanese food, too.

03:23.180 --> 03:24.930
Just tomorrow, then.

03:24.930 --> 03:27.010
If I don't like it, then it'll be the first and last time.

03:27.470 --> 03:28.270
Okay!

03:28.270 --> 03:30.020
I'll do my best!

03:40.440 --> 03:41.320
How may I help you?

03:41.320 --> 03:44.700
I am a servant of the Blanche family.

03:44.700 --> 03:49.500
I have come in search of a Japanese lady who was rumored to be here.

03:52.830 --> 03:55.250
What does the Blanche family want with Yune?

03:56.880 --> 03:59.760
My Mistress would like to have tea with her.

04:01.010 --> 04:03.840
With me?

04:06.050 --> 04:07.050
Come in.

04:08.810 --> 04:13.190
Staying in the bath for too long is not good for you, Madam Alice.

04:13.940 --> 04:15.440
How foolish.

04:15.440 --> 04:18.610
Only old people believe that hot water is bad for you.

04:18.610 --> 04:21.610
The East is very advanced in that respect!

04:22.450 --> 04:25.320
There are hot baths with many naked people inside,

04:25.320 --> 04:28.450
who bathe together with a great garden view!

04:29.700 --> 04:32.910
That is definitely a wonder of the East!

04:39.380 --> 04:44.630
I have given the Japanese girl the invitation, Madam Alice.

04:44.630 --> 04:47.760
Oh my gosh!

04:47.760 --> 04:49.140
So, what did she look like?!

04:49.560 --> 04:51.390
Was she like this doll?

04:51.390 --> 04:53.730
Or perhaps she was like this portrait of a beautiful woman?!

04:54.770 --> 04:57.480
These kinds of women really do exist!

04:57.480 --> 04:59.570
They wear this kind of kimono,

04:59.980 --> 05:01.940
have pitch black hair,

05:01.940 --> 05:05.110
and have a long, white face!

05:05.110 --> 05:07.160
Madam Alice...

05:07.160 --> 05:07.740
What is it?

05:07.740 --> 05:10.370
I delivered the invitation,

05:10.370 --> 05:12.580
but she promptly refused.

05:13.750 --> 05:15.830
What the heck do you mean?

05:15.830 --> 05:16.830
Well...

05:17.330 --> 05:21.380
Don't do it, Yune.
You're not really prepared for a party yet.

05:21.380 --> 05:22.840
You'll just humiliate yourself.

05:22.840 --> 05:24.340
O-Okay.

05:24.340 --> 05:27.090
That darned Claude Claudel!

05:27.090 --> 05:30.550
I knew he was an annoying man.

05:32.260 --> 05:33.560
But, fine.

05:34.310 --> 05:39.650
I, the owner of the <i>Galerie du Roy</i>,

05:39.650 --> 05:41.070
will pay a visit.

06:22.730 --> 06:23.860
What are you doing?!

06:23.860 --> 06:26.360
I-I was just taking a bath! I'm sorry!

06:26.360 --> 06:28.320
I'll clean this up-

06:30.240 --> 06:30.820
What happened?!

06:31.700 --> 06:33.330
I'm sorry...

06:34.540 --> 06:36.750
What are you two doing this late?

06:36.750 --> 06:40.000
Check to see if there's any water leaking through the floor, Grandpa!

06:40.000 --> 06:42.750
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

06:45.750 --> 06:47.920
Taking a bath?

06:47.920 --> 06:49.760
I'm very sorry!

06:52.430 --> 06:55.510
You've been holding back that urge, right, Yune?

06:55.510 --> 06:59.230
She used to take a bath every day back when she was in Japan.

06:59.230 --> 07:02.440
That's something only rich people can afford to do in Paris.

07:04.190 --> 07:06.690
I was being selfish.

07:06.690 --> 07:08.070
I won't do it again.

07:08.070 --> 07:09.320
Of course you won't.

07:09.320 --> 07:12.450
The neighbors will hate us for wasting water.

07:17.080 --> 07:19.580
Is Japan <i>that</i> different than Paris?

07:28.590 --> 07:29.840
Let's go.

07:29.840 --> 07:32.220
I got pretty dirty from cleaning the floor last night,

07:32.220 --> 07:34.090
so I want to go wash off at the bathhouse.

07:36.850 --> 07:38.470
I'm fine.

07:39.100 --> 07:42.270
I'm the one who told you to take your time getting used to things here,

07:42.270 --> 07:44.190
so let me practice what I preach.

07:46.070 --> 07:47.690
Hurry up and get ready.

07:49.230 --> 07:50.190
Okay!

07:55.870 --> 07:57.030
What?

07:57.030 --> 08:00.040
You've relaxed quite a bit lately.

08:00.040 --> 08:01.790
Shut up!

08:03.750 --> 08:04.830
And then...

08:19.430 --> 08:21.680
How do you do, Claudel-san?

08:22.310 --> 08:24.020
Madam Alice Blanche!

08:24.020 --> 08:26.940
I have come here because I heard a certain rumor.

08:26.940 --> 08:32.320
Is it true that you have begun selling Japanese items?

08:34.700 --> 08:36.320
Sorry to make you wait.

08:44.830 --> 08:46.540
This is her, right?!

08:46.540 --> 08:47.920
Wh-What?

08:47.920 --> 08:50.130
You really <i>are</i> wearing a kimono!

08:50.130 --> 08:52.590
It's so different from what I imagined!

08:53.470 --> 08:54.840
You're so tiny!

08:54.840 --> 08:56.050
Are you seriously alive?

08:56.050 --> 08:57.550
You're so mysterious!

08:57.550 --> 08:59.810
I'm taking you home!

09:02.310 --> 09:05.310
How much will you sell this girl for, Claudel-san?!

09:05.310 --> 09:07.310
I'm sorry, she isn't for sale...

09:07.310 --> 09:09.520
Oh, come on!

09:13.440 --> 09:17.200
Give her back, Claude Claudel!

09:19.490 --> 09:21.620
Who was that just now?

09:21.620 --> 09:23.250
Alice Blanche.

09:23.250 --> 09:24.750
Stay away from her.

09:24.750 --> 09:26.750
She's an upstart bourgeois,

09:26.750 --> 09:28.500
and has no principles.

09:28.500 --> 09:31.550
But, isn't it rude to just leave her like that?

09:34.090 --> 09:36.220
She's just crazy about Eastern culture.

09:36.220 --> 09:39.550
She'll do whatever she wants with you, and you'll regret it.

09:41.930 --> 09:44.060
How do you do, Yune-san?

09:54.440 --> 09:57.740
You're Claudel-san's maid, right?

09:57.740 --> 09:59.700
How would you like to work for me?

09:59.700 --> 10:01.070
U-Um...

10:01.070 --> 10:04.660
She isn't a maid; she also has a house in Japan.

10:04.660 --> 10:06.120
Oh?

10:06.120 --> 10:10.920
That makes sense, since she had such a gorgeous kimono.

10:10.920 --> 10:14.210
If she isn't a maid, then, is she an orphan?

10:14.210 --> 10:15.420
A relative?

10:15.420 --> 10:17.010
I'm just taking care of her.

10:17.010 --> 10:19.430
For who?

10:19.430 --> 10:20.590
Japan.

10:23.140 --> 10:26.520
Isn't that a huge burden?

10:26.520 --> 10:29.100
Come to my place, Yune-san!

10:29.100 --> 10:32.360
You won't have to worry about housing, clothes, or food!

10:32.360 --> 10:33.520
Huh?

10:39.280 --> 10:42.280
Closed

10:42.660 --> 10:46.330
Damn, we have to wait until it opens in the afternoon.

10:51.000 --> 10:54.630
You're using this run-down public bathhouse?

10:54.630 --> 10:56.000
Go away.

10:56.000 --> 11:00.180
I'll let you use one of our extra bathrooms, Yune-san!

11:00.180 --> 11:03.010
You seem to be enjoying a life made from money you stole from others.

11:03.510 --> 11:06.720
How many stores do you think you put out of business?

11:06.720 --> 11:10.520
Yune-san! Would you like to have some tea with me?

11:10.520 --> 11:12.270
Let's go, Yune.

11:13.480 --> 11:13.980
Um...!

11:16.650 --> 11:22.030
I'd like to talk with Alice-sama for just a bit, if you don't mind.

11:22.030 --> 11:22.740
Oh, my!

11:22.740 --> 11:23.910
Why?

11:24.370 --> 11:29.290
It's rude to refuse without talking to her at all.

11:33.040 --> 11:34.040
Yay!

11:34.040 --> 11:36.300
I'm so happy, Yune-san!

11:36.300 --> 11:38.880
Fine, do whatever you want.

11:38.880 --> 11:41.340
Come on, Yune-san, get on!

11:48.970 --> 11:50.350
Look!

11:50.350 --> 11:53.060
That's my brother's <i>Grand Magasin</i>!

11:53.060 --> 11:54.230
That theater is his, too!

11:54.860 --> 11:58.400
My brother is very elegant, unlike Claude!

11:58.400 --> 12:01.240
That's my mother's Salon!

12:20.840 --> 12:23.010
How is your tea?

12:23.010 --> 12:25.550
I-It's very good.

12:25.550 --> 12:27.100
I've never had this kind before.

12:28.140 --> 12:32.430
Men always drink coffee,
so you never get to drink tea, do you?

12:36.980 --> 12:40.730
Paris is definitely a woman's city.

12:40.730 --> 12:44.070
I want to show you more of Paris' beauty.

12:45.570 --> 12:46.820
Okay...

12:55.330 --> 12:56.290
Oh, my.

13:01.340 --> 13:03.050
Camille!

13:03.050 --> 13:06.130
Is this the rumored <i>Japonaise</i>-san?

13:08.640 --> 13:10.260
It's a pleasure to meet you!

13:12.140 --> 13:13.770
Isn't she cute?

13:13.770 --> 13:15.140
Her name is Yune-san.

13:17.150 --> 13:21.820
Alice-chan has been in love with you.

13:22.690 --> 13:23.690
What's wrong?

13:26.950 --> 13:31.540
Everyone in Paris has such beautiful eyes.

13:31.540 --> 13:36.040
Camille-sama, Alice-sama, and Claude-sama.

13:37.000 --> 13:39.000
Everyone...

13:40.630 --> 13:45.010
Your pitch black eyes are also very mystical!

13:45.010 --> 13:49.510
Also, it's okay to forget about Claude while you're here!

13:49.510 --> 13:51.100
Oh, I know!

13:51.100 --> 13:51.850
Come on!

13:51.850 --> 13:52.760
U-Um-

14:04.530 --> 14:05.360
Hey, Claude!

14:06.610 --> 14:09.870
That was the Blanche family's girl, right?

14:09.870 --> 14:11.870
What'd they want with the <i>Galerie</i>?

14:16.250 --> 14:19.120
Oh yeah, what happened to that <i>Japonaise</i>?

14:19.920 --> 14:22.090
She went to the Blanche house.

14:22.090 --> 14:24.760
Oh, so she finally left.

14:24.760 --> 14:25.380
What?

14:25.380 --> 14:28.880
You aren't very suited to take care of someone,

14:28.880 --> 14:31.510
so I thought that it would end up this way eventually.

14:33.680 --> 14:37.060
It's been a while; want to go get some dinner?

14:37.060 --> 14:39.390
I'm busy today!

14:39.390 --> 14:41.270
What are you so upset about?

14:45.440 --> 14:46.440
How do you like it?

14:46.440 --> 14:50.700
It's just the guest room, but I'll have it remodeled just for you!

14:50.700 --> 14:53.240
It even has a bathroom, too!

14:53.240 --> 14:55.200
Prepare a bath for Yune-san.

14:55.200 --> 14:56.620
Yes, ma'am.

14:56.620 --> 14:59.210
Oh, but I-

15:01.750 --> 15:02.710
What do you think?

15:03.710 --> 15:07.840
You can take warm baths every day here.

15:07.840 --> 15:10.720
I'll give you lots of cute dresses, too!

15:11.300 --> 15:12.970
Why don't you just stay here?

15:14.140 --> 15:16.930
Is Claude just fooling you?

15:17.560 --> 15:20.310
That kimono seems pretty fishy.

15:20.310 --> 15:24.690
How could he sell such an important keepsake?

15:24.690 --> 15:25.770
It's not like that!

15:27.570 --> 15:32.950
I gave that kimono to him as an apology.

15:32.950 --> 15:40.460
When Claude-sama found out that it was my
mother's memento, he promised to buy it back.

15:40.870 --> 15:44.040
Claude-sama would never fool me.

15:46.630 --> 15:49.090
I should be heading home, now.

15:50.300 --> 15:52.800
Wait! You can stay a little longer, right?

15:52.800 --> 15:54.800
Dinner is almost ready!

15:55.350 --> 15:56.560
Dinner?

15:57.850 --> 15:59.100
Oh, dinner!

15:59.100 --> 16:01.980
What's all this fuss about all of a sudden?

16:02.850 --> 16:06.020
I remembered an important promise I made.

16:06.020 --> 16:06.820
What?

16:06.820 --> 16:08.820
When can I meet you again?

16:08.820 --> 16:10.820
I'm not sure.

16:10.820 --> 16:13.160
Claude-sama would have to...

16:14.660 --> 16:15.780
No!

16:15.780 --> 16:17.870
Make a promise to me, too!

16:17.870 --> 16:20.620
We can eat together tomorrow, right?

16:20.620 --> 16:22.120
Alice-sama...

16:22.120 --> 16:25.210
You won't gain anything by going back!

16:25.210 --> 16:27.170
Why are you insisting on staying there?

16:27.540 --> 16:34.340
Oscar-sama and Claude-sama are very kind to me, so I can't turn them down.

16:35.840 --> 16:37.640
Kind?

16:37.640 --> 16:44.520
I need to return their kindness tenfold.

16:49.980 --> 16:50.980
So...

16:51.650 --> 16:53.700
How about this?

16:53.700 --> 16:58.410
If you agree to stay here, I'll return this to you for free.

16:58.410 --> 17:00.120
What?

17:00.120 --> 17:02.870
It's impossible for Claude to buy this.

17:04.080 --> 17:08.420
There's no way that little shop could make that kind of money, even in a year's time.

17:09.880 --> 17:14.880
All you have to do is say one little thing,
and you can rid Claude of his burden.

17:47.080 --> 17:49.750
She hasn't come back yet?

17:49.750 --> 17:51.090
Is that all right?

17:51.090 --> 17:55.800
She'll be happier under the care of a rich family.

17:57.840 --> 18:03.100
No matter how much I hate that family's ways,

18:03.100 --> 18:06.600
or count up all the stores that they put out of business,

18:06.600 --> 18:09.020
I just can't do anything without money.

18:09.020 --> 18:14.400
I can't even entertain a small foreign guest.

18:14.940 --> 18:18.320
Yune would be quite pitiful if she actually came back here.

18:18.320 --> 18:21.370
That isn't something you can decide.

18:23.290 --> 18:28.330
I just wish she would think about herself more.

18:28.330 --> 18:31.380
Why did you even bring her here?

18:41.720 --> 18:42.680
Yune?

18:42.680 --> 18:45.470
I'm sorry I'm late!

18:46.980 --> 18:49.350
Welcome home, Yune.

18:49.350 --> 18:50.520
I'm back!

19:02.620 --> 19:03.870
Ew...

19:03.870 --> 19:08.830
I'm surprised you gave her back so willingly, just because of a promise she made.

19:08.830 --> 19:10.330
I didn't do it willingly.

19:11.120 --> 19:14.670
Yune-san is actually a very stubborn girl!

19:17.630 --> 19:18.840
Yune-san?

19:18.840 --> 19:20.550
What are you doing?!

19:21.050 --> 19:23.050
She got on all fours,

19:23.050 --> 19:27.060
and stayed there for an hour, saying that she wouldn't move unless she could come back here.

19:27.060 --> 19:29.520
Oh, that pose.

19:29.520 --> 19:32.520
That's Yune's most stubborn pose.

19:34.940 --> 19:36.820
Uh- Sorry...

19:36.820 --> 19:41.320
So, what was that very important promise you were talking about, Yune-san?

19:41.910 --> 19:43.160
This!

19:43.660 --> 19:47.660
You promised to make Japanese beef stew, right?

19:48.330 --> 19:50.040
Th-That's all?

19:51.040 --> 19:53.540
This is definitely it!

19:54.540 --> 19:56.540
It <i>does</i> smell like soy sauce.

19:56.540 --> 19:58.920
I lost to this?

20:01.420 --> 20:05.300
Why didn't you take the kimono offer?

20:05.300 --> 20:08.560
I even told you that I'd return it to you for free.

20:10.930 --> 20:15.110
It's my duty to trust him when he makes a promise.

20:15.650 --> 20:20.780
Could you be the judge of my trustworthiness until that time comes?

20:20.780 --> 20:27.740
I can't just take it upon myself to fulfill a promise <i>he</i> made to me.

20:31.410 --> 20:34.670
Being left out feels terrible.

20:34.670 --> 20:37.920
That's probably what you're thinking.

20:39.090 --> 20:40.300
What?

20:41.800 --> 20:45.050
I just can't stand to let this man take care of you!

20:45.590 --> 20:49.930
I'll keep that room open all the time, so you can come over anytime for a bath!

20:49.930 --> 20:52.730
Wasn't our tea <i>way</i> better, too?

20:52.730 --> 20:56.310
I really want to take you home!

21:09.910 --> 21:16.500
aa marude yume wo miteru you na

21:09.910 --> 21:16.500
ああ、まるで夢を見てるような

21:09.910 --> 21:16.500
Ah, it's as if I'm in a dream

21:16.500 --> 21:22.300
yawarakana hikari no naka de

21:16.500 --> 21:22.300
柔らかな光の中で

21:16.500 --> 21:22.300
As I lie here in this tender light

21:22.300 --> 21:33.310
me wo tojite mimi wo sumasereba kikoete kuru

21:22.300 --> 21:33.310
目を閉じて耳を澄ませれば　聞こえてくる

21:22.300 --> 21:33.310
When I close my eyes and listen, I can hear it

21:35.140 --> 21:48.200
atatakaku watashi wo yobu yasashii sono koe ga

21:35.140 --> 21:48.200
あたたかく私を呼ぶ優しいその声が

21:35.140 --> 21:48.200
That kind voice that warmly calls to me

21:50.780 --> 21:57.370
afureru omoi wo tsutaetai kono te kara

21:50.780 --> 21:57.370
溢れる思いを伝えたい　この手から

21:50.780 --> 21:57.370
